Exceptions to the license above:

The demos in the demos/ directories, and the testmachine header files in
src/include/testmachine/, are placed in the public domain. This way, they
can be reused in projects which for some reason are incompatible with the
conditions required by the BSD-style license.

Some of the header files in the src/include/ directory, containing definitions
of bitfields for hardware devices etc., are copied from NetBSD and other
sources. If you plan to redistribute GXemul (for example as a binary package),
or reuse code from GXemul, then you should check those files for their
license terms.


